		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Lapis and azure scales form a mesmerizing spiral pattern. Cunning, cruel, has no thirst nor need to drink.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16, <strong>HP</strong> 57, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 rend +7 (2d8) or 1 lightning breath, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> -1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Lightning Breath</strong>. A straight line (5' wide) extending double near from dragon. DEX 15+ or 4d8 damage (DISADV on check if wearing metal armor).</p><p></p><p><strong>Parch</strong>. A section of water up to 100 feet in width and depth turns to sand.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stormblood</strong>. Electricity immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
